i protected Janada Island from the Nokkers years ago, the Guardians have grown a considerable following and are recognized throughout the world. Initially reluctant, Fushi allows the Guardians to accompany him to the site of the Nokkers' recent attack. In their village, Fushi meets a few valuable allies, both new and old. But as the conflict with the Nokkers only leads to more loss, Fushi must find the inner strength to face his inevitable sorrow.\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"},"tags":[{"name":"Shapeshifting","rank":97,"spoiler":false},{"name":"War","rank":93,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Time Skip","rank":82,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Found Family","rank":82,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":81,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Philosophy","rank":81,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":81,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Cult","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ghost","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Religion","rank":77,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Body Horror","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Yandere","rank":75,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gore","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Medieval","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Crossdressing","rank":70,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Shounen","rank":65,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Animals","rank":61,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gender Bending","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Suicide","rank":57,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Historical","rank":56,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Zombie","rank":52,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Agender","rank":51,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Indigenous Cultures","rank":40,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"To Your Eternity Season 2","english":"To Your Eternity Season 2","native":"不滅のあなたへ Season 2","romaji":"Fumetsu no Anata e Season 2","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"致不灭的你 第二季"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"给不灭的你 第二季、給不滅的你 第二季"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Fumetsu no Anata e 2"}]},"trailer":{"id":"xlULSshsTHc","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi